flowchart LR
  S[Source systems
  collections CSVs] --> R[Raw immutable
  versioned files + manifests]
  R --> ST[Staging
  schema checks, trim, null normalization]
  ST --> Q[Quarantine + DQ ledger
  exact dupes, invalids, conflicts]
  ST --> C[Clean canonical tables
  typed columns, source lineage]
  C --> G[Golden entities + facts
  account, payment, account-month]
  G --> F[Features
  cohorts, channel exposure, agent tenure]
  F --> M[Metric layer
  versioned definitions + denominators]
  M --> D[Executive dashboard / memo]
  ST -. late events / schema drift .-> MON[Monitoring + alerts]
  C -. referential, null, duplicate checks .-> MON
  G -. reconciliation + freshness .-> MON
  MON --> BF[Backfill by event date
  idempotent partitions]
  BF --> C
